cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below, with the version and the rules hash of your reports."
title: "Flagwake Responder Check"
abstract: >-
  A free, offline, re-checkable test of how an AI defender behaves during a security incident,
  scored with business cost. Fictional incidents in an invented company, a scripted intruder,
  planted instructions in untrusted text, and a report whose every number is re-derived from the
  stored commands. It describes behaviour in this test only, not real-world security skill.
type: software
authors:
  - name: "Sid"
license: AGPL-3.0-only
repository-code: "https://github.com/Sid00011/Flagwake"
keywords:
  - incident response
  - security agents
  - evaluation
  - injection resistance
  - reproducibility
version: 0.5.0rc6
